      de: ["The battle took place on September 22, 1236", "Decisive victory for the pagan Samogitians and Lithuanians", "Resulted in the total destruction of the Livonian Brothers of the Sword", "Master Volkwin of the Order was killed during the fighting", "Halted the crusaders' rapid expansion in the Baltic region", "The memorial park features towering, expressive wooden sculptures"],
      hu: [],
